+        "O(Delta*N^2) algorithm; at the shipping preset Delta=3 and the exact "
+        "MRV reference proxy performs about 10^5 candidate/path checks (roughly "
+        "one second), while the ladder pattern uses at most 254 colour-assignment "
+        "operations after the symmetry is recognized."
